---
// Hero stays dark regardless of system theme for cinematic impact.
---

<section
  id="top"
  class="relative min-h-screen flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center px-6 overflow-hidden"
  style="background-color: oklch(0.10 0.01 260);"
>
  <!-- Subtle grid overlay -->
  <div
    class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.035]"
    style="background-image: linear-gradient(to right, #ffffff 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(to bottom, #ffffff 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 64px 64px;"
    aria-hidden="true"
  ></div>

  <!-- Content -->
  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <p
      class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-8"
      style="color: oklch(0.55 0.015 260); animation: fadeIn 0.8s ease forwards;"
    >
      Vanchhit · personal site
    </p>

    <h1
      class="font-display font-semibold leading-[1.05] tracking-tight mb-7"
      style="font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 7vw, 5.5rem); color: oklch(0.96 0.005 80); animation: fadeUp 0.8s 0.2s ease both;"
    >
      A quiet corner for{' '}
      <span style="color: oklch(0.72 0.15 250)">projects</span>,{' '}
      <span style="color: oklch(0.78 0.15 70)">writing</span>,
      <br class="hidden sm:block" />
      and the places I keep going back to.
    </h1>

    <p
      class="text-lg md:text-xl max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed mb-12"
      style="color: oklch(0.58 0.02 260); animation: fadeUp 0.8s 0.4s ease both;"
    >
      Aviation, trains, AI safety, and climate — plus a small map of
      countries visited and spots worth a detour.
    </p>

    <div
      class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4"
      style="animation: fadeUp 0.8s 0.6s ease both;"
    >
      <a
        href="/blog"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full text-sm font-medium transition-opacity hover:opacity-85"
        style="background-color: oklch(0.96 0.005 80); color: oklch(0.10 0.01 260);"
      >
        Read the blog
        <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M2 10 10 2M5 2h5v5"/>
        </svg>
      </a>
      <a
        href="/projects"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full text-sm font-medium transition-colors"
        style="border: 1px solid oklch(0.40 0.01 260); color: oklch(0.75 0.015 260);"
        onmouseover="this.style.borderColor='oklch(0.60 0.01 260)'; this.style.color='oklch(0.90 0.005 80)';"
        onmouseout="this.style.borderColor='oklch(0.40 0.01 260)'; this.style.color='oklch(0.75 0.015 260)';"
      >
        See projects
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Scroll cue -->
  <div
    class="absolute bottom-10 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5"
    style="color: oklch(0.42 0.01 260); animation: fadeIn 1.2s 1s ease both;"
    aria-hidden="true"
  >
    <span class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-widest uppercase">Scroll</span>
    <svg class="animate-bounce" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
      <path d="M8 3v10M4 9l4 4 4-4"/>
    </svg>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  @keyframes fadeUp {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }
    to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }
  @keyframes fadeIn {
    from { opacity: 0; }
    to   { opacity: 1; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    * { animation: none !important; }
  }
</style>
